  chef: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd96477d5695e8349a71dcd12e8bd8d2, type: 2}
  letterBody: 'My dear,


    Rosa here, with my last secret for you.


    Tres
    leches is my celebration cake. Weddings, baptisms, the day my grandson finished
    university. Three milks soaked into a soft sponge, so every bite is sweet all
    the way through.


    Bake a light sponge with flour and eggs. Poke it all over,
    then pour in milk, condensed milk and cream until it drinks every drop. Cover
    with whipped cream and chill.


    Your shop is famous now, but I hope you remember
    why you started. You cook so that strangers feel at home. That is worth celebrating.'
